WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.158 --> 00:00:01.998
- It feels really good. It feels natural.

00:00:01.998 --> 00:00:02.967
- [Man] It's got a little heft to it.

00:00:02.967 --> 00:00:04.418
Like it feels right,
you know, not too heavy.

00:00:04.418 --> 00:00:06.248
- It feels good!

00:00:06.248 --> 00:00:10.029
(funky music)

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:15.674
- We're about to go into the Apple event.

00:00:15.674 --> 00:00:17.551
I have never been here before.

00:00:17.551 --> 00:00:19.636
- I'm really excited to
try on the Apple watch.

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:21.847
I need to get that black and gold,

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:23.063
you know what I'm saying.

00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:25.434
- Trying on the watch, I
think is gonna be amazing.

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.448
- This is how I feel right now.

00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:30.814
It's beautiful.

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:32.941
Oh my God, all these people are here

00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:34.360
just to show us a watch?

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.573
- [Voiceover] Staff on hand to help you

00:00:36.573 --> 00:00:40.157
try them on to have the
ultimate experience.

00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:42.117
- Already this feels amazing.

00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:42.886
Oh my God!

00:00:45.287 --> 00:00:48.248
Dude, I'm going to reply with an emoji.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:50.208
That changes that game
for messaging, I think,

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:51.407
for really young people.
- [Woman] It's really fun.

00:00:51.407 --> 00:00:52.532
- And it's right on my wrist.

00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:54.057
That's so easy. I love this.

00:00:54.057 --> 00:00:55.033
- It feels very classy.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:56.590
It's almost kind of like vintage.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.091
Like old Hollywood feeling.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.551
I feel kind of like a movie star

00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:01.663
mixed with an astronaut.

00:01:01.663 --> 00:01:03.680
I'm not sure, maybe a Power Ranger.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.517
- Hey, Siri, where's
the closest Starbucks?

00:01:07.225 --> 00:01:09.478
Nice. Thanks, Siri.

00:01:09.478 --> 00:01:11.285
- I hope that I can draw a flower

00:01:11.285 --> 00:01:13.370
like they did in the demo.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:15.317
I feel a little bit like a preschooler,

00:01:15.317 --> 00:01:16.360
but that's okay.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:17.864
- [Woman] Hey, it's perfect!
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:17.879 --> 00:01:18.618
- [Woman] That's amazing!
- I did it!

00:01:18.618 --> 00:01:20.280
(laughs) I did it!

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:23.447
- Look at the flick of the wrist.

00:01:23.447 --> 00:01:24.017
- How's it feel?

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.067
- It feels good.

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.412
It feels like it's not really there.

00:01:27.412 --> 00:01:28.414
It feels like a good watch.

00:01:28.414 --> 00:01:29.498
It's a piece of technology so you

00:01:29.498 --> 00:01:30.874
would think it might be heavy.

00:01:30.874 --> 00:01:33.210
- If I'm, like, at a party
and a guy's being super creepy

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.544
I can just like double-tap it

00:01:34.544 --> 00:01:37.088
and that will be, like,
come save me right now.

00:01:37.088 --> 00:01:38.048
Rescue me.

00:01:38.048 --> 00:01:40.258
Girl code, like, taken to the next level.

00:01:40.258 --> 00:01:43.346
- I like that when you
turn, the face comes up.

00:01:43.346 --> 00:01:46.306
I'm a simple kinda girl
in a simple kinda world

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:47.994
and I really like that.

00:01:47.994 --> 00:01:49.893
It just gets the point across,
that's what time it is.

00:01:49.893 --> 00:01:52.771
- In the demo, I was almost
worried that it would be

00:01:52.771 --> 00:01:54.481
a little bit tough to grasp.

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.566
It seemed like there were
so many things to do.

00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:57.943
But it's really easy.

00:01:57.943 --> 00:01:59.319
- I like the way that this one feels.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:00.529
It's a little bit heavier.

00:02:00.529 --> 00:02:02.656
I'm a small girl, so that's
kind of rough for me.

00:02:02.656 --> 00:02:05.321
The leather ones feel good,
but this one right here,

00:02:05.321 --> 00:02:06.994
this feels like a man's watch.

00:02:06.994 --> 00:02:08.662
You know, I would like to
see a man wearing this one.

00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:10.423
I feel like Ironman.

00:02:11.855 --> 00:02:13.293
- I think it's gonna change the way that

00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:14.709
we talk to each other.

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:18.213
Before I was a little
skeptical about the watch,

00:02:18.213 --> 00:02:21.008
but after seeing it in
action and wearing it,

00:02:21.008 --> 00:02:23.093
I want it so badly.

00:02:23.093 --> 00:02:25.428
- Black and gold is my favorite.

00:02:25.428 --> 00:02:26.972
The watch is gorgeous.

00:02:26.972 --> 00:02:28.890
It was an awesome experience.

